@startuml
title Use Case 2.4: Shelter Animals Management
actor ShelterMember
participant ShelterAnimals.vue
participant animals.ts
participant animals.py
participant animal_service.py
database MySQL

ShelterMember -> ShelterAnimals.vue: Visit /shelter/animals
ShelterAnimals.vue -> ShelterAnimals.vue: Get shelter_id from authStore
ShelterAnimals.vue -> animals.ts: listAnimals(shelter_id)
animals.ts -> animals.py: GET /animals?shelter_id=X
animals.py -> animal_service.py: list_animals()
animal_service.py -> MySQL: SELECT animals WHERE shelter_id
MySQL --> animal_service.py: animals[]
animal_service.py --> animals.py: result
animals.py --> animals.ts: 200 OK
animals.ts --> ShelterAnimals.vue: animals
ShelterAnimals.vue --> ShelterMember: Display shelter animals

alt Update Animal
  ShelterMember -> ShelterAnimals.vue: Edit animal
  ShelterAnimals.vue -> animals.ts: updateAnimal(id, data)
  animals.ts -> animals.py: PATCH /animals/{id}
  animals.py -> animal_service.py: update_animal()
  animal_service.py -> MySQL: UPDATE animals
  MySQL --> animal_service.py: updated animal
  animal_service.py --> animals.py: animal
  animals.py --> animals.ts: 200 OK
  animals.ts --> ShelterAnimals.vue: success
  ShelterAnimals.vue --> ShelterMember: Success message
else Export Data
  ShelterMember -> ShelterAnimals.vue: Click Export
  ShelterAnimals.vue -> ShelterAnimals.vue: Generate CSV from data
  ShelterAnimals.vue --> ShelterMember: Download CSV file
end
@enduml